  m_Name: WhatBreathesUnderTheRoots
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: SafeHaven::QuestDefinition
  id: whatbreathesundertheroots
  displayName: What Breathes Under the Roots
  description: 'The breathing hollow is found, and the portal can reach it now: Guardian''s Hollow, deep in the Misty Woods. Something old breathes under the roots there. It will not wake for steel. Carry an ember from your own hearth to it, wake it, and bring it down.'
  chain: The Hearth and the Door
  journalNotes: 'Make the ember at any campfire, from three sticks. Guardian''s Hollow is in the portal''s list now. Beyond the mist there is no way out but through: come ready, fed, with tonics and draughts, and your gear mended. The Heartroot fights in three stages and it has a clock: wait too long and it stops holding back. If it beats you, you can try again.


    It is the forest''s guardian, or it was. Nobody at home is sure which.'
